        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e78d24a547ae4c28bbfa14f6de8d0ce2",
      "statement": "Every dump runs through a single run_dump path that never fails the script: a failed dump leaves a DUMP-FAILED-<name> marker inside the snapshot, the remaining dumps and the restic upload and retention still run, and the run's exit status reports the failure so the unit's OnFailure= alert fires. This isolation exists because the original script's Forgejo step was the only step without a fallback, so under set -e its failure skipped every database dump and the off-site upload.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/runbooks/Server-Setup-Runbook.md",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:f1cf1e65d23cd8dcc90f81b0493c287e91ff5b74ae0eab042c0a0f8800a8bf50"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://infrastructure-as-code/backup/backup.sh",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:384e287f3552e86ded8908f48fa31e525bdd1d0eb14dffc21fbc8d2389fa90d7"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://scripts/__tests__/backup-script.test.mjs",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:c0b18b4b2b60ec3ffe5343ffcc8bbe61affb986ce58dc115ba8114b87e3055e7"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_21f35f4eba0a4cde90e3e968b3c29d25",
      "statement": "Each dump is validated after it is written, in its own format and against a per-dump minimum size, and a dump that fails either check is treated exactly like a failed dump command. The formats are per dump: a plain Postgres dump must end at the pg_dump/pg_dumpall completion marker, the forge's custom-format database dump must start with the PGDMP magic, a Mongo archive must pass gzip -t, and the forge data tar must list git/repositories/, gitea/conf/app.ini and gitea/jwt/ — the signing keys without which every issued token and the Actions OIDC identity change on restore. The minimum may legitimately be near zero — agent-db's is 1 byte because agent_db has no tables by design, the gateway checkpointing in memory — so a non-empty test alone would be wrong.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/runbooks/Server-Setup-Runbook.md#L1067-L1076",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:00f5a7609fb00b5b301e9d0ee21345a5b8d1d72d6bf6278f92afb7130f8a8423:"
        },
