    {
      "id": "claim_0d72d7b4af66473c80950aaf59e678d8",
      "statement": "restic retention must group by tag, not by path: the call carries --tag homelab --group-by host,tags because the staging directory's name is random, so restic's default host,paths grouping put every snapshot in a group of one and pruned nothing. The same randomness is why the staleness check lists all homelab snapshots rather than using --latest, which is per path group.",
      "evidence": [
