    {
      "id": "claim_abb56ad9b938473087ff0c670374edd1",
      "statement": "The alert needs an issues-scoped token in a mode-600 file and the forge's local URL (MCM_FORGE_URL) in an env file beside it; the token is passed to curl through a header file rather than argv so ps and the journal never see it. A missing or loose token or an unset URL exits 3 and an HTTP failure exits 4, each printing 'alert NOT delivered' to the journal rather than failing silently, and the posted detail is redacted — URI user-info masked and any line naming a credential dropped.",
