    {
      "id": "claim_fd380e745f7b442cbb6ea3e3f1a7859b",
      "statement": "The dump list is the part that must grow with the host: the original script dumped only Forgejo, Komodo and the object-store/nx-cache config directories and no application database, so a reboot that corrupted Forgejo's Postgres left Forgejo the only stateful service with a real backup. The standing rule is that adding a stateful service means adding its dump to backup.sh, with a minimum size and a format check.",
