    {
      "id": "claim_92520b53d8054aeeb0ac99b4579af8ed",
      "statement": "release-apks is dumped from the forge's generic-package API using ~/backup/forge-package-token (mode 600, package read only) and MCM_FORGE_URL, as an uncompressed tar of release-apks/<version>/<file> covering every version and every file, paginated in pages of 50 because q= is a substring match that an unpaginated read silently truncates. A missing or loose token, or a version whose file list cannot be read, fails that dump alone: every other dump and the retention prune still run.",
